{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根士丹利：药明康德业务与季度数据观察</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">药明康德在8月3日发布<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>业绩后，将全年收入增长指引从18-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">22%</span>上调至35-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">39%</span>，对应收入区间为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">585亿</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">605亿元</span>人民币。这份MS研报认为，业绩<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>并非一次性因素，而是商业合同、TIDES业务放量和美国市场收入占比提升共同作用的结果。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">上半年药明康德实现收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">289亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">38.9%</span>，净利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">111亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">29.4%</span>，分别超出MS预期<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12%</span>。剔除出售药明合联部分股权和CRO业务的一次性影响后，调整后净利润上半年增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">83.2%</span>，二季度单季增长91.7%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWwdJBaZDQxdzzdmhiagYhpeyYo90Apfiav6Baat8WK4I6RkZZ6u7ohZqbccrgLFWyL7ygPQicUgeTFicrQCGonRtZUyiaYiblCzQskQ/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">研究主题与行业变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告将业绩<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>主要归因于商业合同的持续积累。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>药明康德新增6个商业合同，上半年累计新增12个，总数达到95个，其中多数处于市场独占期和专利保护期内。在手订单同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">25%</span>，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>，达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">664亿元</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这些高批量、长周期的商业合同是小分子D&amp;M业务增长的核心驱动。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>小分子D&amp;M收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">67%</span>，小分子R业务增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>。报告特别指出，商业合同的数量和订单转化效率是判断CDMO企业中期收入能见度的关键指标，药明康德的book-to-bill比率自<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025年</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>以来持续高于1.20。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">编辑评论</span>：</strong> 商业合同数量从83个增至95个，看起来只是数字变化，但每个合同都对应一款药物的商业化生产订单。在手订单<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">664亿元</span>相当于全年收入指引的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.1倍</span>以上，这为后续季度的收入兑现提供了缓冲。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVJibVD0ahyupTvicLJdVfR3TrB1oJ0tJTmlgKNCB5PmKvFtuLXkTboe8uTbGdCs9K4VaqT0k5YHunFpkvc0XZrVbvxFI9iafuX4k/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2.TIDES业务与近期数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">TIDES业务（多肽和寡核苷酸）是本次指引上调的另一重要支撑。二季度TIDES收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">75%</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>增速为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>，呈现明显的逐季<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>态势。报告将全年TIDES收入增长指引从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">40%</span>上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">45%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这一<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>与GLP-1类药物的外包生产需求直接相关。报告认为，TIDES业务的产能利用率和订单能见度在行业内具有代表性，其增速变化可以作为观察多肽CDMO景气度的参考指标。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOX5ualsp6zYKGzvxFhSVR96zqnwJ6r7f4ISJW7tSL4B3874u5mAZnOvlMSJib5GDrfaqpJELIbmZWAetNKVG0ruJkVTPLCkQrtQ/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">研究主题与行业变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">上半年药明康德来自美国市场的收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">62%</span>，占总收入比重从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025年</span>上半年的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">71%</span>升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">77%</span>。报告认为，这一数据在一定程度上缓解了市场对地缘政治影响的担忧。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">化学业务毛利率上半年同比<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>7.4个百分点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">56.4%</span>，报告将其归因于项目向后期推进带来的产能利用率提升。全年资本开支指引从65-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">75亿元</span>上调至75-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">85亿元</span>，同时全年调整后净利率保持稳定。</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">4. 新分子类型贡献测试与生物学业务三分之一收入</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">新分子类型（new modalities）上半年贡献了测试和生物学业务各约三分之一的收入。这一比例说明药明康德的收入结构正在从传统小分子向更广泛的生物技术领域延伸。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告同时列出了需要关注的变量：商业合同终端市场销售若<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">低于预期</span>、VC/PE融资波动以及中美关系变化，都可能对业绩产生影响。这些因素在报告的不确定性部分被明确标注。</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">5. 观察框架：book-to-bill比率与商业合同数量</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWEJ1kMWYL7ZNZA5HbKMiat56fhM2zWYI423qnicr7zxTN1wS5hqAc35ibF3RsIujpNcy31ialf0aE6dpOM0OkK7ib8QuldKUBREicKs/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 61-MS-WuXi AppTec Co Ltd-603259-2Q26 a Strong Beat - Significant Lift to Full-Year Guidance-260803</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
